# Round 18, C2-14 (follows). L §5.14.1 Running reads: "a binding over a decision's movements, or over pads ... the decision
# declares the move or the kind in reads (reads pads)"; E §3.1 step 7 now marks it. fix binds over pads with no reads:
# LOAD-READS (L §8.3). With reads pads it is a decision and loads (L5_14_1_pads_binding_reads).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-06-30
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 2026-01-01..
input day: date

move fix: transfers
  on day
  leg cash from world to konto amount sum(p.cash.amount for p in pads over month_of(day) - 1)

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  day = 2026-03-10
  opening[konto] = 0 PLN at 2026-01-01 start

ask q: bal(konto, 2026-03-31)
=== expect
refused: LOAD-READS fix reaches a running read or projection of pads without reads pads ...
